00:00:35.267 --> 00:00:38.167 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'est mon corps à moi.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.034 size:53% position:73% line:53%
SYLVIE PEDNEAULT, directrice

00:00:37.367 --> 00:00:39.900 size:53% position:73% line:53%
