00:00:38.267 --> 00:00:40.767 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Comment je me sens?

00:00:39.134 --> 00:00:41.667 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Je suis outrée, en fait!

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.667 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Une brèche préoccupante

00:00:40.867 --> 00:00:43.867 size:53% position:73% line:53%
