00:00:47.633 --> 00:00:51.467 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- La question qui nous vntnt

00:00:48.834 --> 00:00:52.500 size:53% position:73% line:53%
c'est : jusqu'où va

00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:53.567 size:53% position:73% line:53%
