00:01:29.867 --> 00:01:32.867 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ces objeeueurs de conscience

00:01:30.634 --> 00:01:34.067 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ont néanmoins la responsabilité

00:01:31.434 --> 00:01:35.300 size:53% position:73% line:53%
