00:01:45.167 --> 00:01:48.734 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le pharmacien au Jean Coutu de

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:49.967 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Chicoutimi a admis avoir réfusé

00:01:47.633 --> 00:01:51.167 size:53% position:73% line:53%
