00:01:48.834 --> 00:01:52.400 size:53% position:73% line:53%
par le passé,

00:01:50.067 --> 00:01:53.633 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tout en déclinant notre

00:01:51.267 --> 00:01:54.867 size:53% position:73% line:53%
