00:02:07.434 --> 00:02:11.867 size:53% position:73% line:53%
son expérience lui aura laissée

00:02:09.467 --> 00:02:11.867 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un arrière-goût amer.

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:11.867 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Je me suis jamais sent

